# Agent X local engine artefacts. The SQLite file holds sealed case data and the
# keyfiles are the root/signing keys minted on first run when no env key is set
# -- committing either would publish the material that makes crypto-shredding
# meaningful.
data/*.db
*.rootkey
*.signkey
